libdecor-cairo: vmlab: the title bar looks like GTK's Yaru-dark header bar, with a full screen button

For the Mac VM's window (mac26.sh), whose title bar this plugin draws: the same height, colours,
title font (VMLAB_DECOR_FONT, a Pango font name, in bold; VMLAB_DECOR_FONT_AA=rgba for subpixel
text), round buttons and icons (vmlab-icons.h, made by ../gen-icons.py from the desktop's icon
theme) as the Windows VM's GTK title bar, so the two windows match. One more button, left of
minimize, makes the window full screen. No title bar is drawn while the window is full screen.

Apply with patch -p1 in libdecor-0.2.2 (the tarball beside this file, unpacked).

